---
args: { input: CaseInput, goal: GoalContract, policy: PolicySelection, evidencePlan: EvidencePlan }
returns: PreparedEvidence
---
Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for interpretPreferences. Read member requests and prior agreements to identify desired uses, availability, and explicitly stated access needs. Separate preferences from accepted communal obligations and avoid inferring personal circumstances or assigning work without consent. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
